  condcomp.break-helper,198,fenced,null,null,non-executable,The repeat(exp) sketch leaves repeat and exp undefined and uses a prose ellipsis for the error branch.,null
  condcomp.break-label-sketch,207,fenced,null,null,non-executable,"The label example contains ellipses in both the body and break site, so it is an incomplete placeholder.",null
  condcomp.break-reduce-sketch,217,fenced,null,null,non-executable,The reduce example contains an ellipsis in its branch and is not a complete jq program.,null
